# 3A-Factory Workflow (Cursor)

Read `AGENTS.md` and `WORKFLOW.md` before making changes.

## Pipeline
`triage → (grill-me) → analyze → ADR? → design → spec → Planning? → develop → review → qa` → stop.
Deploy: separate command + always `APPROVED`.

## Dual entry
- `project-manager`: auto-run; if unclear → grill-me; when clear / “execute now” → continue.
- `grill-me`: deep clarification; write `docs/requirements/REQ-<NNNNNN>-<slug>-discovery.md`.

## Hard gates
- No coding from raw requirements.
- High risk → Planning + `APPROVED` before develop.
- Develop follows plan or design scope.
- Never auto-deploy; every deploy needs `APPROVED`.

## Artifacts
Write under `docs/{requirements,designs,reviews,qa,release-notes}` (+ `docs/project_overview.md` from `/onboarding`).
Ids: `REQ-<NNNNNN>-<slug>` / `ADR-<NNNNNN>-<slug>` (6 digits); branch `feature/REQ-<NNNNNN>-<slug>`.
**Artifact body language: Vietnamese.** Instruction/rules language: English.

## Skills
Execute the matching `.cursor/rules/<skill>.mdc` or `.agents/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md`.
New repos: run `/onboarding` first.
